{'hotel_name': 'Viscay Hotel', 'address': '960 Collins Ave, Miami Beach, FL 33139, USA', 'place_id': 'ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U', 'latitude': None, 'longitude': None, 'rating': 3.9, 'user_rating_count': 185, 'business_status': 'OPERATIONAL', 'google_maps_url': 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=7285475669576529779&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', 'reviews': [{'name': 'places/ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGNE5WbDZYMUZuVDBKYWJXSnJWV1Y2TlVRNFEwRRAB', 'relativePublishTimeDescription': '2 months ago', 'rating': 4, 'text': {'text': '3.5/5 stars. The best thing about the hotel is its location. 2 minutes from the beach, many cafes and restaurants, grocery stores, clubs, etc. With that, it was quite noisy at night - you can clearly hear all of the street traffic. Not sure about other rooms, but ours had a window that was taped shut so we couldn’t open it. Probably wouldn’t have wanted to anyway since the view was an alleyway. The room itself is outdated and the bathroom could use an upgrade, but overall it was pretty comfortable and had what we needed. The second best thing is the reception staff and service. They are so kind, attentive, and helpful if you have any questions or requests. I would stay here again, but with ear plugs!', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'originalText': {'text': '3.5/5 stars. The best thing about the hotel is its location. 2 minutes from the beach, many cafes and restaurants, grocery stores, clubs, etc. With that, it was quite noisy at night - you can clearly hear all of the street traffic. Not sure about other rooms, but ours had a window that was taped shut so we couldn’t open it. Probably wouldn’t have wanted to anyway since the view was an alleyway. The room itself is outdated and the bathroom could use an upgrade, but overall it was pretty comfortable and had what we needed. The second best thing is the reception staff and service. They are so kind, attentive, and helpful if you have any questions or requests. I would stay here again, but with ear plugs!', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'authorAttribution': {'displayName': 'Olivia', 'uri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116476772464906574446/reviews', 'photoUri': 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIIyWbhziKkk5EWc9c9fjtw2pQSousSr0-P677TRMZetW-t0k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3'}, 'publishTime': '2026-03-02T13:36:25.893966797Z', 'flagContentUri': 'https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGNE5WbDZYMUZuVDBKYWJXSnJWV1Y2TlVRNFEwRRAB&d=17924085&t=1', 'googleMapsUri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGNE5WbDZYMUZuVDBKYWJXSnJWV1Y2TlVRNFEwRRAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b48d8a436a05:0x651b358578dc3773'}, {'name': 'places/ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SSFdUZ3lWV3RTYjNWZlZEWTFjVVE1V0VOc2IyYxAB', 'relativePublishTimeDescription': '3 months ago', 'rating': 5, 'text': {'text': "I have to say it's a wonderful place. The friendly receptionist treated us very well; we were very tired when we arrived to check in, and he helped us. The service is wonderful. He'll remember us as the family Chilena . Thank you very much.", 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'originalText': {'text': "I have to say it's a wonderful place. The friendly receptionist treated us very well; we were very tired when we arrived to check in, and he helped us. The service is wonderful. He'll remember us as the family Chilena . Thank you very much.", 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'authorAttribution': {'displayName': "Oso's Tattoo", 'uri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114875421669089996720/reviews', 'photoUri': 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXz0SK7qaLzAhRUGQ9lyXanDwxYVuanpav42JlrM2U0Wvy-B_g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3'}, 'publishTime': '2026-01-29T21:09:06.005500576Z', 'flagContentUri': 'https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SSFdUZ3lWV3RTYjNWZlZEWTFjVVE1V0VOc2IyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1', 'googleMapsUri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SSFdUZ3lWV3RTYjNWZlZEWTFjVVE1V0VOc2IyYxAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b48d8a436a05:0x651b358578dc3773'}, {'name': 'places/ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFeFFVTjJNSGt5V0dSNFlWcExlV0l3VEVaaVRsRRAB', 'relativePublishTimeDescription': '3 months ago', 'rating': 1, 'text': {'text': 'DONT EVER BOOK HERE - I just called this hotel to inquire because I'm trying to set something special up for my son's birthday legitimate I picked up the phone I asked him questions about the reviews I saw online as any traveler will do before going to a location never been to. After I ask him a question he immediately said" who are you, I don't know who you are, you sound like a scam a setup, don't call her ever again" I am appalled by her rude he was I literally have been calling all hotels because I want to plan something special for my child this is the first hotel who told me my questions were a scam I would never stay here or consider staying here and I don't advise anyone else to stay here I have never been treated so rude that is disgusting. And just so everyone's aware I read reviews before I book anything that's anyone should and I only asked him two questions 1. Reviews online indicate that the air conditioners don't always work can you please speak to that? 2. Reviews online indicated there are mixed reviews on our friendly the front desk staff is I just want to make sure we have a great trip can you please speak to that?', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'originalText': {'text': 'DONT EVER BOOK HERE - I just called this hotel to inquire because I'm trying to set something special up for my son's birthday legitimate I picked up the phone I asked him questions about the reviews I saw online as any traveler will do before going to a location never been to. After I ask him a question he immediately said" who are you, I don't know who you are, you sound like a scam a setup, don't call her ever again" I am appalled by her rude he was I literally have been calling all hotels because I want to plan something special for my child this is the first hotel who told me my questions were a scam I would never stay here or consider staying here and I don't advise anyone else to stay here I have never been treated so rude that is disgusting. And just so everyone's aware I read reviews before I book anything that's anyone should and I only asked him two questions 1. Reviews online indicate that the air conditioners don't always work can you please speak to that? 2. Reviews online indicated there are mixed reviews on our friendly the front desk staff is I just want to make sure we have a great trip can you please speak to that?', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'authorAttribution': {'displayName': 'Iam Mehi', 'uri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104365461655742395308/reviews', 'photoUri': 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTYSrMjYQ33xnjOd-9u_MiUExQSdkiThcCjBBEwCKZE7NUzy0TRg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4'}, 'publishTime': '2026-02-05T15:54:29.700426106Z', 'flagContentUri': 'https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFeFFVTjJNSGt5V0dSNFlWcExlV0l3VEVaaVRsRRAB&d=17924085&t=1', 'googleMapsUri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFeFFVTjJNSGt5V0dSNFlWcExlV0l3VEVaaVRsRRAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b48d8a436a05:0x651b358578dc3773'}, {'name': 'places/ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNveThiSzJ3RRAB', 'relativePublishTimeDescription': 'a year ago', 'rating': 5, 'text': {'text': 'Excellent Stay in the Heart of South Beach

I had a wonderful experience at this hotel! The cleanliness was truly outstanding — everything was spotless and well-maintained. The hosts were extremely kind, welcoming, and always ready to help with a smile. The location couldn’t be better — right in the heart of South Beach, close to everything you need: the beach, restaurants, and nightlife. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and friendly stay in Miami!', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'originalText': {'text': 'Excellent Stay in the Heart of South Beach

I had a wonderful experience at this hotel! The cleanliness was truly outstanding — everything was spotless and well-maintained. The hosts were extremely kind, welcoming, and always ready to help with a smile. The location couldn’t be better — right in the heart of South Beach, close to everything you need: the beach, restaurants, and nightlife. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and friendly stay in Miami!', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'authorAttribution': {'displayName': 'Αναστασια Κοκονα', 'uri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101219776175453422577/reviews', 'photoUri': 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3N5f4MR3B4BKp-tY2F83AnsTDThtYCXFpus1kiu2dxIbLjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo'}, 'publishTime': '2025-04-19T23:24:28.885680Z', 'flagContentUri': 'https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNveThiSzJ3RRAB&d=17924085&t=1', 'googleMapsUri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNveThiSzJ3RRAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b48d8a436a05:0x651b358578dc3773'}, {'name': 'places/ChIJBWpDio202YgRczfceIU1G2U/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ0Z3X1RLNThmaHNBRRAB', 'relativePublishTimeDescription': '11 months ago', 'rating': 1, 'text': {'text': 'Don’t let the cheap prices trick you. The owner, who also works at the front desk, was arrogant and unhelpful. When we asked about parking, he just said: ‘Do whatever you want.’ Very poor hospitality. We paid 200 bucks more to parking. We woke up 2–3 times during the night because of noise from the street. The sound insulation was terrible.', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'originalText': {'text': 'Don’t let the cheap prices trick you. The owner, who also works at the front desk, was arrogant and unhelpful. When we asked about parking, he just said: ‘Do whatever you want.’ Very poor hospitality. We paid 200 bucks more to parking. We woke up 2–3 times during the night because of noise from the street. The sound insulation was terrible.', 'languageCode': 'en'}, 'authorAttribution': {'displayName': 'Sezin AK', 'uri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100337012960723425837/reviews', 'photoUri': 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJlGlXs0JSIIT3Ni4ppbCk7-22_TMwXF4XlOdXPkc2jhhmQkw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3'}, 'publishTime': '2025-06-06T14:19:11.615908Z', 'flagContentUri': 'https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ0Z3X1RLNThmaHNBRRAB&d=17924085&t=1', 'googleMapsUri': 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ0Z3X1RLNThmaHNBRRAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b48d8a436a05:0x651b358578dc3773'}], 'signals': {'review_decline': False, 'review_rating_delta': 2.33, 'review_volume_decline': False, 'complaint_increase': False, 'renovation_needed': True, 'old_property': False, 'physical_condition_score': 2, 'franchise_loss': False, 'former_brand': '', 'franchise_affiliated': False, 'current_brand': '', 'brand_status': 'NONE', 'cmbs_watchlist': False, 'cmbs_special_servicing': False, 'cmbs_delinquent': False, 'long_term_owner': False, 'ownership_length_years': '', 'distress_score': 5}, 'heuristic_scores': {'distress_score': 5, 'distress_reasons': ['Moderate-to-low rating with enough reviews: 185', 'Negative review signal: rude', 'Negative review signal: noise', 'Renovation signals in reviews: 60.0%'], 'review_trend_score': 0, 'review_volume_recent': 3, 'review_volume_prior': 1, 'review_volume_change_pct': 200.0, 'avg_rating_recent': 3.33, 'avg_rating_prior': 1.0, 'review_rating_delta': 2.33, 'complaint_rate_recent': 0.33, 'complaint_rate_prior': 1.0, 'review_complaint_delta': -0.67, 'year_built': '', 'property_age': '', 'renovation_signal_rate': 0.6, 'renovation_needed': True, 'physical_condition_score': 2}, 'llm_analysis': {'distress_probability': 0.65, 'seller_fatigue_probability': 0.3, 'opportunity_score': 55, 'llm_star_rating': 2.8, 'top_distress_signals': 'Moderate-to-low rating with sufficient reviews, frequent mentions of rude staff and noise issues, high renovation need indicated by 60% of reviews, low physical condition score (2)', 'investment_thesis': 'Viscay Hotel presents a moderate distress opportunity driven by operational challenges including guest complaints about staff behavior and noise, combined with significant renovation needs. The property is unbranded and not franchise affiliated, limiting brand support but allowing repositioning flexibility. Moderate distress score and low seller fatigue suggest potential for value creation through targeted operational improvements and renovation.', 'acquisition_strategy': 'Operational Turnaround', 'review_summary': 'Guests frequently report issues with rude staff and noise disturbances, impacting overall satisfaction. Operational concerns are evident but not worsening, with no decline in review volume. Cleanliness and service are moderate but overshadowed by maintenance and renovation needs. Guest sentiment shows improvement in recent ratings, indicating potential for recovery with focused upgrades and service enhancements.', 'confidence': 'LOW', 'recommended_action': 'Monitor', 'distress_summary': ''}, 'owner_data': {'owner_name': 'VISCAY LLC', 'owner_company': 'VISCAY LLC', 'mailing_address': '960 COLLINS AVE, MIAMI BEACH, FL 33139-5010', 'owner_phone': '', 'ownership_since': '', 'ownership_length_years': ''}, 'cmbs_data': {'cmbs_loan_status': '', 'cmbs_delinquency_flag': False, 'cmbs_watchlist_flag': False, 'cmbs_special_servicing_flag': False}, 'franchise_data': {'franchise_affiliated': False, 'current_brand': '', 'former_brand': '', 'brand_status': 'NONE', 'franchise_confidence': 'Low'}, 'source_location': 'South Beach, Miami Beach, Florida', 'radius_km': 2.0}
